1. `research_map/formulation_taxonomy.yaml:200`: "... J^-(q) over all q in I+) is strictly stronger; it is registered as variant `SET` of this ..." — WRONG (should be strictly weaker). But F0 canonical is frozen 0abb9ed8a961 (G-F0 gate) — cannot write without voiding G-F0.
